{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. He helps him to find the Mystery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Wizard on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush through the Space before the Time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Wizard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzle Exploration focused. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2233080?t=1755104453","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2233080?t=1755104453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2233080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755104453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2233080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755104453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. He helps him to find the Mystery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Wizard on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush through the Space before the Time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Wizard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzle Exploration focused. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Infiniti Sound Imagery Studios","Cine Game Interactive Syst